[8:30AM] #LekkiEpeExpWay
#TrafficUpdate

There's a rapid vehicular movement from Ilaje to Ajah under Jubilee bridge en-route Addo Badore road (both inwards and outwards) and connecting Alesh.
Ajah back to Abraham Adesanya is also good.

Inward and outward of Ogombo road connecting Lekki-garden phase 2, Alasia, LBS, Olokonla to Ogidan, sangotedo and ShopRite.
 From ShopRite down to Abijo, Awoyaya, Lakowe, Frajend and Eleko junction is also in good shape, likewise the return journey from Eleko junction down to Ajah under bridge.

Effort to evacuate an Audi car that lost control and crashed overnight at Lekki Garden phase 2 inward Abraham Adesanya has been initiated.

